Paste an eligible YouTube URL → process accessible content → inspect timestamps → generate notes → convert a revision sheet to handwritten notes.

D. Official paper
Find a verified paper → open Paper PDF → start its mock → answer and mark questions → submit → inspect scoring and complete solutions → create targeted revision.

