Open a meaningful mind map → inspect an explanation and source → add a flashcard → review it → update learning evidence.

H. Tools
Calculate scientific expressions → plot new user-entered equations → change ranges → verify discontinuities and invalid input.

I. Rewards
Complete eligible activity → award XP once → refresh and retry → confirm no duplication → sync across devices.

J. Voice
Start → speak → receive audio → End Session → verify silence, released capture and rejected late responses.

K. Discovery
Find each existing feature through its section, Search or App Guide.

L. Data
Restore a legacy account → verify migrated content → switch accounts → verify isolation → test export and deletion using test accounts.

